d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"opaque","provider":"anthropic","kind":"thinking","data":{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"}},{"type":"text","text":"What should I watch for changes? I need three things:\n\n1. **What to watch:** a web page URL, or a search query describing where to look.\n2. **What to extract:** the value or text to track, such as \"lowest round-trip fare in CAD\" or \"the in-stock status of the item.\"\n3. **When to alert:** any change, a change of at least a certain size, a value going above or below a threshold, or specific text appearing.\n\nOnce you tell me these, I'll set up the watch. It will stay inactive until you confirm it in the app."}]},"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":252,"cache_read_input_tokens":4517,"cache_creation_input_tokens":80},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","refusal_category":null}]}
